    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naMosi hampidi yaSinayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Hoshaku nawanyana kaIsarela, wuyili neyi, Chimwakashika mwituŋa dinukuyinka, ituŋa chiŋa dakanookaŋa sabata yambala yaYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iha deyiwakadidimaŋa nyaka yitanu nawumu, itempa deyi danyivinyu wakadiloŋeshaŋa nyaka yitanu nawumu, wakadiilaŋaku mbutu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwinza mumwaka wamuchitanu nachiyedi mwakekalaŋa sabata yakunooka ituŋa kunookakwakudi hudika, hisabata yambala yaYehova, kudima iha deyi hela kuloŋeshaitempa deyi danyivinyu nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakudya yeyi yakudimenena kuyaŋulanehi, hela nyikabu yakunyivinyu yeyi yiwunabuli kuloŋesha kuyikumuna nehi, himwaka wakunooka ituŋa kunooka kwakudihudika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyi sabatayetuŋa yakekali yakudi ilaŋamu kudya kwenu, nineyi, ninduŋu yeyi weyala, ninduŋu yeyi wamumbanda, niŋamba yeyi, ni mwenyi weyi wakupeeka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niyimuna yeyi, nanyama adi mwituŋa deyi, mbutu jakamenamu jejima akadyi tuhu kwawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakadi chindilaŋa sabata janyaka jitanu najiyedi, hinyaka yitanu nayi yedi yamapampa katanu nakayedi, wakeseka mafuku asabata jitanu naji yedi jinyaka, hinyaka makumi awana nanyaka yitanu nayiwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakembishampinja chakola hefuku dekumi dakakweji kamuchitanu nachiyedi; ifukudakubuta nyiloŋa didu wakembisha mpinja mwahita ituŋa denu dejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakajilikaŋa mwaka wamakumi atanu, akabideki mwahita ituŋa, akayishimwini antu ejima ashakamamu kufuma muwuduŋu kunenzi dehi; wakekalaŋa mwaka wenu wajubili, mwaka funtafuntaŋa wejima wenu, iwukumpata yindi yaheteliyi, iwu kuchisaka chindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenowu mwaka wamakumi atanu wakekalaŋa wajubili yenu, kudima nehi, hela kwaŋula yakudya yakudimenena nehi, hela kukumuna kunyivinyu yimunabuli kuloŋesha nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hŋubili, mwakayimoni kujila, mwakadya ŋayi kusoŋa mumaha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwa kowu wajubili mwaka funtafuntaŋa wejima wenu kumpatajenu jimwaheteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi wakalandisha mukwenu chuma, indi kwiji wakalanda chuma kudi mukwenu, bayi mwakadikoŋaŋa chatamaku;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakelaŋa yidika yami, mwakahembaŋa mwaya wuŋaji wami nakwilamu, kulonda mushakami chakadi kwakama mwituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niituŋa dakasoŋa mbutu jadu, mwakadya mwakekuta, mwakasha kamamu chakadikwakama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keŋa mwili nenu, Indi mwaka wamu chitanu nachiyedi twakadyadi? Tiya, hitwa kadimaku, hitwaka aŋula mbutu jetuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohuhamwaka wamu chitanu nawumu nakayiletela nkisu yami, wakasoŋmbutu janyaka yisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wamu chitanu nachisatu mwakadima, mwakadya mbutu jajikulu jimwaswekeli, dye-e, nikumwaka wamuchitanu nachiwana ninichi chimwa kamuna mbutu jenu, mwakadyaŋa jenu jaji kuluji mwaswekeli hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituŋa kudilandisha chahaya nyaka chinjila, muloŋa hiituŋa dami, muloŋa enu muyenyi, mwashakamamu tuhu nanami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwahita ituŋa dimwakaheta mwejima mwaketŋiŋa kukuula ituŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mana kweyi nekali dehi kazweŋi, nalandishi dehi chibalu champatayindi yahetayi, kawusoku windi asemukayi nindi akenzi, akakúulimpata yanalandishiyi mana kwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi hadi muntu nabuli wakuyikúulaniyena naheti dehi yakuyikúula nachu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akachindi nyaka yayilandishiliyi, akamulunjikiluku owu muntu alandishiliyi, akafunti cheŋi kumpatayindi yaheteliyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi nakaŋnyi kuyitambula cheŋi yemwenindi, oyuyanalandishiyi yakashali kuchikasa chanowu wayilandili kushika nikumwakawajubili, mujubili yakafunti cheŋi yakekali cheŋi yindi, akafunti cheŋi kumpata yindi yaheteliyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi muntu wakalandisha itala damumukala wampwembu, wakatweshakudikúula cheŋi himuchidi kanda muhiti mwaka wamana chikupu nanahahadilandiliyi, mukuhitaŋa mwaka wamana wakatwesha kudikúula cheŋi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mwaka wamana wunahiti dehi kudikúula nehi, denodu itala dekalamumukala wampwembu dinekali dehi dambala danowu wadilandili, dindichikupu nimwamba kavwalikilaŋa anyanindi chanyaka yejima; hidakafunta cheŋi mujubiluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa matala amunyikala yakadi kunyeŋu mwishampwembu, akayeseki hohamu namaha amumpata; akatwesha kuyikúula, akafunti cheŋi mujubili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, nyikala yawaLevi, nimatala amunyikala yanahetuwu, aLevi akutwesha kuyikúula tuhu honsu hanayikúuliluwu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi akalanda nakaLevi niitala danalandishuwu nimukalawaheteliyi yakafunti cheŋi mujubili; muloŋa matala amunyi kalaya waLevi hiluhetu lwawu lwamudi anyana kaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwinza mahaakunsa janyikala yawu kuyilandisha chinjila; hiluhetu lwawu lwahayanyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mana kweyi neli dehi kazweŋi jinamukaŋi dehi, kamukwashuku; hela himwenyi wenza nakutuŋa, kashakami nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakamu dyanŋalanyi hela kusha kwoku, chiŋa wumutiyaŋa Nzambi yeyi woma kulonda wushakami namana kweyi chachiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakakongwesha mukwenumali eyi wudiilahu nŋalanyuku, hela kumusondamisha yakudya yeyi wudi ilahuya kumotweshaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yami Yehova Nzambi yenu nayi fumishili mwituŋa daEjipitu, kulonda niyinki ituŋa daKenani, kulonda niikali Nzambi yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mana kweyi wekala nindi neli dehi kazweŋi kweyi, nadilandi dehi kudeyi, bayi wakamukalakesha neyi chakalakeshaŋawu nduŋuku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kashakami nindi neyi chakushakama naŋamba hela nawakupeeka, akakukalakeli chakushikija kumwaka wajubili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akafumi cheŋi kudeyi henohu, niyena nanyanindi kumu, akafunti cheŋi kuchisaka chindi, akafunti cheŋi kumpata yindi yaheteli ankakulula jindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muŋa hiyambuŋami inafumishili mwituŋa daEjipitu, kuyilanda ekali anduŋu chinjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wikala nkaka yindi wakalaku, chiŋa wakamutiyaŋa Nzambi yeyi woma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi munakeŋi kuheta anduŋu amayala nawambanda kalandenu kudinyuza yayinyeŋumuka, diku kumwakalandila anduŋu jenu amayala nawambanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela kudi anyana kawenyi ayipeeka, diku kumwakalandila, nikuchisaka chawu chimwekala nachu anavwalikili mwituŋa denu, mwakayihetatuhu hiluhetu lwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa diwu mwakeli wuswana wakuswanaŋa anyanenu akalondelaŋa mudenu akayihetaŋa hiluhetu lwawu; wenawadiwu akekalaŋa anduŋu jenu ahaya nyaka; ilaŋa ana kwenu, anyana kaIsarela, hosi wakekali nkaka yamukwawu wakalaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi hadi mwenyi wakupeeka nekali dehi waheta, nimana kweyi neli dehi kazweŋi, nadilandi dehi kudi mwenyi wakupeeka, hela kudi akwachisaka chamwenyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyi anamulandi dehi akatwesha kumukúula; mana kwindi wumu wakatwesha kumukúula; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hela mandumi yindi helamwana kamandumi yindi wakatwesha kumukúula, hela hadi asemukayinindi kuchisaka chindi wakatwesha kumukúula; hela neyi naheti dehi yemweni wakatwesha kudikúula tuhu yemweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akachindi nanowuwamulandili kufumishila hamwaka wadilandishiliyi kudi yena nakushikŋi kumwaka wajubili, yakafwetayi yakeseki mwomukweseka nyaka yakeŋa kushakamayi nindi, mwomwesekelaŋawu nyaka yaŋamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi muchidinyaka yayivulu mwomukwesekela nyaka, dimu mwakufuntishilayi nindanduyakumukúula kufumisha kumali amulandiluwu nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi kunashali dehi nyaka yantesha hohu nakushika kumwaka wajubili, akachindili hamu, mwomukwesekela nyaka, dimu mukwesekela nindandu yakumukúula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akashakami nindi neyi chashakamaŋawu naŋamba akwataŋawu hamwaka hamwaka; bayi akekala nkaka yindi wakala kumesu eyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyianabuli kumukúula mwenimu, akadifumini tuhu kwindi mumwaka wajubili, niyena nanyanindi kumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ami namoni anyana kaIsarela namihiyambuŋami; diwu ambuŋami nafumishili mwituŋa daEjipitu; yami Yehova Nzambi yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.55"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
